
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>North Star Bakery | Contact</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Contact North Star Bakery</h1>
    <p>Questions, special requests, or planning an event? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="products.html">Products</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">About Us</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Ask a Question or Request a Pre-Order</h2>
    <p>Use this form to tell us what you're interested in. Please confirm product availability, pricing, and pickup arrangements with the bakery.</p>

    <form action="#" method="get">
      <fieldset>
        <legend>Your Contact Information</legend>

        <label for="name">Full name:</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
        <br><br>

        <label for="email">Email address:</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
        <br><br>

        <label for="request">Type of request:</label>
        <select id="request" name="request" required>
          <option value="">Choose a request</option>
          <option value="question">General question</option>
          <option value="bread">Bread order</option>
          <option value="pastries">Pastry order</option>
          <option value="cake">Cake or event order</option>
        </select>
        <br><br>

        <label for="date">Requested pickup date:</label>
        <input type="date" id="date" name="date">
        <br><br>

        <label for="details">Order details or message:</label>
        <textarea id="details" name="details" rows="5" required></textarea>
        <br><br>

        <button type="submit">Submit Request</button>
      </fieldset>
    </form>

    <h2>Location and Hours</h2>
    <p>Please contact the bakery to confirm its address, opening hours, and pickup availability.</p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>North Star Bakery | Fresh baking, friendly neighbors.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
